{
  "name": "dsh-music-plugin",
  "description": "音乐播放器插件：把 ```dsh-music 围栏变成右下角悬浮播放器（魅族16 物理比例 277×569，列表固定展开）。网易云扫码登录、四档音源瀑布（会员 → 免费 → QQ → Meting）、同源音频代理、歌词/封面切换、多主题；浏览器环境可拖到窗口边缘转为独立小窗。",
  "version": "0.3.5",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "SKILL.md",
    "README.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/waterfall.test.mjs test/qr-login.test.mjs test/client-bundle.test.mjs",
    "test:smoke": "node test/host-smoke.mjs",
    "preview": "node dev/server.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "music",
    "player",
    "plugin",
    "genui"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "jh-Evil",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/ten-feng/dsh-music.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/ten-feng/dsh-music#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/ten-feng/dsh-music/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
